## Project Identity
Name: Project Sunday
Type: Personal AI assistant (private tool, not a product)
Owner: Alstone, Sydney, Australia
Active hours: 10am–2am AEST (Sydney time)
Primary device: iPhone (mobile browser) — all UI must be mobile-first, 390px baseline

## What This Project Does
A self-improving personal AI assistant that:
- Holds conversations via a Next.js web app (hosted on Vercel)
- Executes real actions on Rohit s MacBook Pro via a Python worker
- Learns about the user over time via a persistent markdown profile
- Routes requests through Gemini (primary) and Ollama (future, for private/sensitive)

## Monorepo Structure
~/Projects/PersonalAI/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/                        ← Next.js 14 App Router (TypeScript, Tailwind)
│   │   ├── app/
│   │   │   ├── page.tsx            ← Root redirect
│   │   │   ├── chat/page.tsx       ← Chat screen (WORKING)
│   │   │   ├── approvals/page.tsx  ← Approvals screen (WORKING)
│   │   │   ├── inventory/page.tsx  ← Inventory screen (STUB)
│   │   │   └── dashboard/page.tsx  ← Dashboard screen (STUB)
│   │   └── components/
│   │       ├── BottomNav.tsx       ← Bottom tab bar (60px)
│   │       └── TopNav.tsx          ← Top nav bar (52px)
│   └── worker/                     ← Python 3.13 asyncio worker (runs on Mac locally)
│       ├── main.py                 ← Entry point, poll loop (polls every 5s)
│       ├── config.py               ← Constants: ALLOWED_WRITE_ROOT, PROFILE_PATH etc
│       ├── context/loader.py       ← Loads user_profile.md into Gemini context
│       ├── executors/
│       │   ├── file_ops.py         ← file_write executor (FULLY WORKING, tested)
│       │   └── profile_ops.py      ← update_profile (STUB — not yet implemented)
│       └── tools/registry.py       ← Tool schema definitions for Gemini
├── context/
│   └── user_profile.md             ← Persistent user profile in markdown
└── supabase/
    └── migrations/                 ← SQL migration files

## Tech Stack — DO NOT CHANGE ANY OF THESE
- Frontend: Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
- Database: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Realtime + Auth)
- Worker: Python 3.13 (asyncio) — local Mac only, never cloud-deployed
- AI Model: Gemini via Google AI SDK (primary)
- Local AI: Ollama (future — not started yet)
- Deployment: Vercel (frontend only)
- Auth: Supabase Auth (already wired, do not modify)

## Database Tables (Supabase)

### messages
id            uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid()
role          text              -- 'user' | 'assistant'
content       text
created_at    timestamptz default now()
session_id    text

### action_queue
id            uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid()
action_type   text              -- 'file_write' | 'update_profile' | 'web_search'
payload       jsonb             -- action-specific parameters
tier          text              -- 'auto' | 'approve'
status        text              -- 'pending' | 'approved' | 'executed' | 'failed'
approved      boolean default false
error         text              -- populated on failure
executed_at   timestamptz       -- populated on success
created_at    timestamptz default now()

## What Is WORKING — Do Not Break These
1. Chat (send/receive messages) — Supabase Realtime, live on Vercel
2. Gemini AI responses — via Google AI SDK in worker
3. Worker poll loop — polls action_queue every 5 seconds
4. file_write executor — end-to-end confirmed: SQL insert → worker → file on disk
5. Path security — traversal, absolute path, hidden file attacks all blocked
6. Supabase Auth — user authenticated, do not touch RLS policies without asking
7. Vercel deployment — live at https://project-sunday.vercel.app

